### ==========================================
### 考勤 Duty CRUD
### ==========================================

### 获取所有考勤记录 (带查询参数)
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty

### 获取所有考勤记录 (带查询参数)
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty?userId=2&startDate=2026-05-01&startTime=00:00:00&endDate=2026-05-31&endTime=23:59:59

### 获取单条考勤记录
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty/120

### 获取单条考勤记录
GET http://localhost:3205/api/duty?id=120

### 创建考勤记录 (打卡上班)
POST http://localhost:3205/api/duty
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "张三",
    "position": "东塔台",
    "dutyType": "主班",
    "inTime": "2025-06-16 08:00:00",
    "roleType": null
}

### 更新考勤记录 (修改席位等信息)
PUT http://localhost:3205/api/duty/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "position": "西塔台",
    "dutyType": "副班"
}

### 删除考勤记录
DELETE http://localhost:3205/api/duty/1
